\bigskip

\noindent{\bf (\ref{bound_p_le10}).}
We follow the argument of the proof of Theorem \ref{main}, part {\bf (\ref{bound_q_m4n4}b)} and use Lemma \ref{lemma:alt} and Theorem \ref{thm:waring_small_estimates}.
