~~0  & \frac{3}{2}& 0\\
-z_c^2 & 0 & 0 
\end{bmatrix}.\label{eq45}	
\end{equation}
The eigenvalues of the above matrix are $-\frac{3}{2}$, $\frac{3}{2}$ and $0$ and  $\left[1, 0, \frac{2}{3}z_c^2\right]^T$, $[0, 1, 0]^T$ and $[0, 0, 1]^T$ are the corresponding eigenvectors respectively.
